WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.298 --> 00:00:22.329
This is what Matdo Check shows the very first time it opens.

2
00:00:22.329 --> 00:00:28.867
Three things to set up: your center, its time zone, and a PIN.

3
00:00:28.867 --> 00:00:34.930
Tap Set Up Your Center.

4
00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:45.261
Type your center’s name. It is shown on your backups.

5
00:00:45.261 --> 00:00:50.285
Then pick your time zone.

6
00:00:50.285 --> 00:00:57.460
This matters: “today” is worked out in the center’s time zone, not the iPad’s.

7
00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:03.196
Tap Continue.

8
00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:08.210
Now the instructor PIN. There is no default one.

9
00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:14.946
Six digits, and not an obvious one.

10
00:01:14.946 --> 00:01:21.387
Type it again to confirm.

11
00:01:21.387 --> 00:01:27.731
Turn on Face ID if your instructors are enrolled on this iPad.

12
00:01:27.731 --> 00:01:33.859
Tap Finish Setup.

13
00:01:33.859 --> 00:01:40.420
Three things to know before your first day.

14
00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:49.433
Tap Get Started. The kiosk is ready.
